material-bluemap
================

This project is a TypeScript port of BlueMap.

BlueMap - https://github.com/BlueMap-Minecraft/BlueMap
Copyright (c) Blue (Lukas Rieger) <https://bluecolored.de>
Copyright (c) contributors
Licensed under the MIT License.

The code in this directory is derived from BlueMap at commit
e664c1abdf697c64703401dca1d7e1956f755f65 (see vendor/BlueMap), with legacy
Minecraft 1.12 support derived from BlueMap tag v0.10.3-mc1.12.

BlueMapAPI - https://github.com/BlueMap-Minecraft/BlueMapAPI
Copyright (c) Blue (Lukas Rieger) <https://bluecolored.de>
Licensed under the MIT License. The marker and API wire formats implemented
here are derived from BlueMapAPI at commit e20166d5ac93feab653392cf30a305a3e255754e.

Minecraft assets (block models, textures) are the property of Mojang AB.
They are NOT distributed with this project; the application downloads the
Minecraft client jar from Mojang's servers at runtime only after explicit
user consent, mirroring upstream BlueMap's "accept-download" flow.

